s in the passage?\",\n      \"options\": [\"A man-made structure built by the Nabataeans\", \"An intricately carved facade that appears to be a natural part of the rock face\", \"A museum housing artifacts from the ancient city\", \"A landmark symbolizing the power of the Roman Empire\"],\n      \"answer\": \"b\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 38,\n      \"question\": \"What is mentioned as a potential consequence of the influx of visitors to Petra?\",\n      \"options\": [\"The site will become more popular and attract even more tourists\", \"The ancient structures will be preserved for future generations\", \"Irreparable damage will be caused to the site's architecture\", \"The local economy will suffer due to decreased tourism\"],\n      \"answer\": \"c\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 39,\n      \"question\": \"What event occurred in 2011 that affected Petra?\",\n      \"options\": [\"A severe earthquake struck the region, causing damage to several buildings\", \"A devastating flood swept through the site, destroying many structures\", \"A group of vandals attacked and damaged several monuments\", \"A major restoration project was completed, preserving the site for future generations\"],\n      \"answer\": \"a\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 40,\n      \"question\": \"What is implied about the author's attitude towards the preservation of Petra?\",\n      \"options\": [\"The author is strongly opposed to any measures to preserve the site\", \"The author believes that the economic benefits of tourism outweigh the costs\", \"The author is concerned about the potential damage caused by over-development and tourism\", \"The author thinks that the site should be abandoned due to its historical significance\"],\n      \"answer\": \"c\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
